            </p>
</div>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            Scholars note that while many verses respond to specific localized incidents, Āyat al-Kursī was revealed directly to establish the unassailable fortress of <em>Tawḥīd al-Rubūbiyyah</em> and <em>Tawḥīd al-Asmā' waṣ-Ṣifāt</em> upon the migration to Madīnah.
          </p>
