<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface leading-normal">
              Root: <strong class="text-primary">ق-و-م (Q-W-M)</strong>. Morphological weight <em class="text-secondary font-medium">Fay'ūl</em> denoting extreme intensiveness and perpetual actuality. It signifies the One who maintains all realms without any reliance upon them.
